OL,3,AUS has floated Ukraine ceding Donbas
OL,4,Afor Nato membership, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS negotiators have touted the idea of
OL,7,FUkraine withdrawing its remaining
OL,8,Fforces from the eastern Donbas region
OL,9,Fin exchange for Nato membership,
OL,10,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky has said.
OL,12,FThe US has not confirmed Zelensky's
OL,13,Fcomments, and a US official told the
OL,14,FBBC "many ideas continue to be
OL,15,Fdiscussed but any final deal will have
OL,16,Fto be agreed to by both parties".
OL,18,FThe Ukrainian leader's comments came
OL,19,Fafter US envoys met Russian President
OL,20,FVladimir Putin and Zelensky as part of
OL,21,FUS efforts to end the war between
OL,22,FRussia and Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
